# Average spending in each category (blank amounts are skipped)
read "expenses.csv" and call it expenses
repeat for each category in the different categories of expenses
    set rows to expenses where category is category and amount is not empty
    if rows is empty
        show "{category}: no amounts"
    otherwise
        show "{category}: {the average of the amounts of rows rounded to 2 decimal places}"
show "Total: {the total of the amounts of expenses}"
